1
00:04:48,750 --> 00:04:54,750
Alvin and the Chipmunks Meet the Wolfman is a family,
fantasy, comedy film directed by Kathi Castillo.

2
00:09:37,500 --> 00:09:43,500
As Alvin struggles with nightmares involving werewolves, the school play of
Jekyll & Hyde is in jeopardy when the lead, Alvin, is suspended.

3
00:14:26,250 --> 00:14:32,250
In an attempt to boost his confidence, the principal suggests
Theodore, who's suddenly going through some canine changes.

4
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:21,000
Alvin Seville / Simon Seville / Dave Seville
(voice), played by Ross Bagdasarian, Jr..

5
00:24:03,750 --> 00:24:09,750
Theodore / Brittany / Jeanette / Eleanor (voice), played by Janice Karman.

6
00:28:52,500 --> 00:28:58,500
Mr. Lawrence Talbot (voice), played by Maurice LaMarche.

7
00:33:41,250 --> 00:33:47,250
Principal Milliken (voice), played by Miriam Flynn.

8
